author=Leekin2
description=AirDrop with iPhone through Xiaomi Share on Xiaomi 15 / 15 Ultra. Press the action button after each boot: loads the AirDrop Wi-Fi stack, patches Xiaomi Share and the share sheet until reboot. Wi-Fi pauses while the Apple share screen is open. Needs Xiaomi Share 5.4.2 (Xiaomi 18 Pro Max).
